[{"sha":"a7f9de7c01e4142b0b346e786f0455813d991d88","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGE3ZjlkZTdjMDFlNDE0MmIwYjM0NmU3ODZmMDQ1NTgxM2Q5OTFkODg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/a7f9de7c01e4142b0b346e786f0455813d991d88","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/a7f9de7c01e4142b0b346e786f0455813d991d88","author":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","date":"2026-06-03T19:07:34Z"},"committer":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","date":"2026-06-03T19:07:34Z"},"tree":{"sha":"101e9fd060127b883b634066c8aeda7374b6edc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/101e9fd060127b883b634066c8aeda7374b6edc0"},"message":"dns, types: add ACME DNS-01 authoritative DNS server for node certs\n\nAdds ACMEChallengeServer, a minimal authoritative DNS server for the configured base_domain that answers the _acme-challenge TXT lookups Tailscale clients use to complete ACME DNS-01 challenges (tailscale cert / tailscale serve --https). It serves only the zone apex SOA/NS and the published challenge TXT records; node A/AAAA records stay internal to the tailnet via MagicDNS.\n\nA new dns.https_certs config block (enabled, listen_addr, nameserver) gates the feature and is validated to require MagicDNS and a base_domain.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01LYishR5SuV14gARRS3LjZU","parents":[{"sha":"5228cb1a408e29b67d72720894c80ac489f11daa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/5228cb1a408e29b67d72720894c80ac489f11daa","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/5228cb1a408e29b67d72720894c80ac489f11daa"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGeN2X2a\nxRu4H5f0oMDnlWxeQ7wF6NIGg1qu8//n/24uejXCx6l0KGSuOg+nb6mdFZjMI63SJNUR8IgIJVu+\nzwI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 101e9fd060127b883b634066c8aeda7374b6edc0\nparent 5228cb1a408e29b67d72720894c80ac489f11daa\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780513654 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780513654 +0000\n\ndns, types: add ACME DNS-01 authoritative DNS server for node certs\n\nAdds ACMEChallengeServer, a minimal authoritative DNS server for the configured base_domain that answers the _acme-challenge TXT lookups Tailscale clients use to complete ACME DNS-01 challenges (tailscale cert / tailscale serve --https). It serves only the zone apex SOA/NS and the published challenge TXT records; node A/AAAA records stay internal to the tailnet via MagicDNS.\n\nA new dns.https_certs config block (enabled, listen_addr, nameserver) gates the feature and is validated to require MagicDNS and a base_domain.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01LYishR5SuV14gARRS3LjZU\n","verified_at":"2026-06-03T19:07:58Z"},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"324c4c5c6ae1c2e68ea9a2090229e4cff24cdbe9","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDMyNGM0YzVjNmFlMWMyZTY4ZWE5YTIwOTAyMjllNGNmZjI0Y2RiZTk","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/324c4c5c6ae1c2e68ea9a2090229e4cff24cdbe9","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/324c4c5c6ae1c2e68ea9a2090229e4cff24cdbe9","author":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","date":"2026-06-03T19:07:40Z"},"committer":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","date":"2026-06-03T19:07:40Z"},"tree":{"sha":"96ff24ab558dfa4a8497a58af57e72785a49696c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/96ff24ab558dfa4a8497a58af57e72785a49696c"},"message":"mapper, noise, app: wire up tailscale serve HTTPS certificates\n\nmapper advertises the node's FQDN in DNSConfig.CertDomains when dns.https_certs is enabled, which is the signal the client needs to allow tailscale cert / serve --https.\n\nnoise implements /machine/set-dns: a node may publish only the ACME challenge record for its own FQDN, which is then served by the authoritative DNS server. getAndValidateNode now takes a node key so both the map and set-dns handlers can share it.\n\napp starts and stops the ACMEChallengeServer with the server lifecycle.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01LYishR5SuV14gARRS3LjZU","parents":[{"sha":"a7f9de7c01e4142b0b346e786f0455813d991d88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/a7f9de7c01e4142b0b346e786f0455813d991d88","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/a7f9de7c01e4142b0b346e786f0455813d991d88"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGYDfkQE\nU0UsuZVxx9FEyzKIF42C+D0oDfFy2LP7JIVNgYWRVczv6k8whw+3JmXdMHFdKjEZcvg+G/v++54j\n7QI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 96ff24ab558dfa4a8497a58af57e72785a49696c\nparent a7f9de7c01e4142b0b346e786f0455813d991d88\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780513660 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780513660 +0000\n\nmapper, noise, app: wire up tailscale serve HTTPS certificates\n\nmapper advertises the node's FQDN in DNSConfig.CertDomains when dns.https_certs is enabled, which is the signal the client needs to allow tailscale cert / serve --https.\n\nnoise implements /machine/set-dns: a node may publish only the ACME challenge record for its own FQDN, which is then served by the authoritative DNS server. getAndValidateNode now takes a node key so both the map and set-dns handlers can share it.\n\napp starts and stops the ACMEChallengeServer with the server lifecycle.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01LYishR5SuV14gARRS3LjZU\n","verified_at":"2026-06-03T19:07:58Z"},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"0e1689ef1b0471c1396f5fb3d9fb2e8c4cec7db6","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDBlMTY4OWVmMWIwNDcxYzEzOTZmNWZiM2Q5ZmIyZThjNGNlYzdkYjY","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/0e1689ef1b0471c1396f5fb3d9fb2e8c4cec7db6","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/0e1689ef1b0471c1396f5fb3d9fb2e8c4cec7db6","author":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","date":"2026-06-03T19:07:47Z"},"committer":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","date":"2026-06-03T19:07:47Z"},"tree":{"sha":"6f1e22adf2d654d10c929602526ba99b2e0e8833","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/6f1e22adf2d654d10c929602526ba99b2e0e8833"},"message":"docs, integration: document and test tailscale serve HTTPS support\n\nAdds a reference page and config example for per-node HTTPS certificates, marks Serve as supported in the features matrix, and records the change in the changelog.\n\nAdds an integration test asserting CertDomains is advertised to a connected client. The full ACME issuance flow is not CI-testable because it requires a publicly delegated base_domain reachable by Let's Encrypt; the DNS server and set-dns handler are covered by unit tests instead.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01LYishR5SuV14gARRS3LjZU","parents":[{"sha":"324c4c5c6ae1c2e68ea9a2090229e4cff24cdbe9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/324c4c5c6ae1c2e68ea9a2090229e4cff24cdbe9","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/324c4c5c6ae1c2e68ea9a2090229e4cff24cdbe9"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJV+T2N/\n/E2LWc1pIXvBT5/3z6n1SvwSpfXW5q028kTwoy18grdnFiBc9QeuHhE2Ymi3s+WOB3LPgoXWCMLi\nIAY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 6f1e22adf2d654d10c929602526ba99b2e0e8833\nparent 324c4c5c6ae1c2e68ea9a2090229e4cff24cdbe9\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780513667 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780513667 +0000\n\ndocs, integration: document and test tailscale serve HTTPS support\n\nAdds a reference page and config example for per-node HTTPS certificates, marks Serve as supported in the features matrix, and records the change in the changelog.\n\nAdds an integration test asserting CertDomains is advertised to a connected client. The full ACME issuance flow is not CI-testable because it requires a publicly delegated base_domain reachable by Let's Encrypt; the DNS server and set-dns handler are covered by unit tests instead.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01LYishR5SuV14gARRS3LjZU\n","verified_at":"2026-06-03T19:07:58Z"},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"0de98dac115f7925ddb2556ea826de1252d16f61","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDBkZTk4ZGFjMTE1Zjc5MjVkZGIyNTU2ZWE4MjZkZTEyNTJkMTZmNjE","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/0de98dac115f7925ddb2556ea826de1252d16f61","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/0de98dac115f7925ddb2556ea826de1252d16f61","author":{"name":"Thomas Zhou","email":"40374754+B00M3000@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-06-03T20:21:54Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-03T20:21:54Z"},"tree":{"sha":"3d262fb07ddd3134b00710f2f67cb470a6031815","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/3d262fb07ddd3134b00710f2f67cb470a6031815"},"message":"Apply suggestions from code review\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","parents":[{"sha":"0e1689ef1b0471c1396f5fb3d9fb2e8c4cec7db6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/0e1689ef1b0471c1396f5fb3d9fb2e8c4cec7db6","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/0e1689ef1b0471c1396f5fb3d9fb2e8c4cec7db6"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqIIzjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA52UQABglRdwwKqxrdHjTn09Dx1XZ\nRzUGVTKGoHaAocFNvln7MmDt3gNlv+hSAdSIlwTv2K8Pk6UkUDClgnNV3wUeCaJ4\nGrQ9CuylzVyIqvVzcITZmY63Z6fnjZUdRv8f2gut0mOo6Js2b9G0uW4YhDnrLuEz\n67UAtDx0wmF0aXMQi0xm4m1Qmf